{"repositoryId":1140615608,"availability":"available","full":"vikneshsrv24/Benchmarked","name":"Benchmarked","description":"Does Nifty50 actually helps us ?","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-01-23T14:25:42Z","updated":"2026-01-28T07:49:10Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://benchmarked.streamlit.app/","topics":["api","pandas","streamlit"],"demo":"https://benchmarked.streamlit.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T09:46:52.686Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T09:46:52.686Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T09:46:52.686Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T09:46:52.686Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Benchmarked is a financial data analysis tool designed to backtest Systematic Investment Plans (SIP) against the Nifty 50 index.","Unlike standard calculators that use estimated annual returns, this application ingests historical market data to simulate real-world investment scenarios. It accounts for daily price fluctuations and executes \"buys\" on specific monthly dates to provide an accurate calculation of wealth accumulation over 10+ years."],"features":["Historical Data Integration: Fetches real-time historical data using the Yahoo Finance API (yfinance), ensuring analysis is based on actual market performance rather than theoretical averages.","Accurate SIP Logic: Utilizes Pandas time-series grouping to convert daily market data into monthly investment buckets, simulating a realistic \"1st of the month\" investment strategy.","Interactive Visualization: Features a dynamic Plotly chart that visualizes the divergence between \"Total Invested Capital\" and \"Current Portfolio Value\" over time.","Vectorized Calculation: Leverages Pandas vectorization for efficient computation of unit accumulation, cumulative sums, and absolute returns.","Indian Market Context: Tailored for Indian investors with INR currency formatting (Lakhs/